  "disclaimer": "本文件只是候选参考稿，不是本项目的正式 L0 原文。只有主编对照底本实物签字之后，才能把对应条目录入 inputs/human/03-zhun-canonical.csv，由 gxwd texts import 写入 data/canonical-texts.json。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text_id": "H03-gua_ci",
      "text_type": "gua_ci",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "屯：元亨，利贞。勿用有攸往。利建侯。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-tuan",
      "text_type": "tuan",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "屯，刚柔始交而难生。动乎险中，大亨贞。雷雨之动满盈，天造草昧。宜建侯而不宁。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-da_xiang",
      "text_type": "da_xiang",
      "line_position": null,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "云雷，屯。君子以经纶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-yao_ci-L1",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": "初九",
      "candidate_text": "磐桓，利居贞，利建侯。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-yao_ci-L2",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": "六二",
      "candidate_text": "屯如邅如，乘马班如。匪寇婚媾。女子贞不字，十年乃字。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-yao_ci-L3",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": "六三",
      "candidate_text": "即鹿无虞，惟入于林中，君子几不如舍，往吝。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-yao_ci-L4",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": "六四",
      "candidate_text": "乘马班如，求婚媾。往吉，无不利。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-yao_ci-L5",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": "九五",
      "candidate_text": "屯其膏，小，贞吉；大，贞凶。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-yao_ci-L6",
      "text_type": "yao_ci",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": "上六",
      "candidate_text": "乘马班如，泣血涟如。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-xiao_xiang-L1",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 1,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "虽磐桓，志行正也。以贵下贱，大得民也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-xiao_xiang-L2",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 2,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "六二之难，乘刚也。十年乃字，反常也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-xiao_xiang-L3",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 3,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“即鹿无虞”，以从禽也。君子舍之，往吝穷也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-xiao_xiang-L4",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 4,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "求而往，明也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-xiao_xiang-L5",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 5,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“屯其膏”，施未光也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    },
    {
      "text_id": "H03-xiao_xiang-L6",
      "text_type": "xiao_xiang",
      "line_position": 6,
      "line_name": null,
      "candidate_text": "“泣血涟如”，何可长也。",
      "status": "candidate_from_ching"
    }
  ]
}
